termination": "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked. The flight and hotel ended up on two separate bookings instead of one combined booking.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. A cheaper flight at $199 has one stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**Why there are two bookings:** I tried to book both together, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through and the hotel hadn't. I didn't retry the combined booking because it could have charged for the flight twice. I booked the hotel by itself instead. Both reservations are now confirmed, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01VPyU1g4RMRENjVYKyV6AJq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019ErF4gpdZE2rZTaEJSZx6s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FeTExRtPjJsR8XFFRCMNve", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FKv61gK4wfaQS6ViQw8bQE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-SFO-JFK-2026-11-